\">(</mo><mn>0.8</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>x</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.8</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\"><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">(</mo></mrow><mfrac linethickness=\"0\"><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\"><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.8</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>x</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>10</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>We want to find the probability that the basketball player makes more than <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"216\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> baskets. So, we compute</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"217\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 22.038em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx