 maxsize=\"2.047em\">(</mo></mrow><mfrac linethickness=\"0\"><mn>6</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\"><mo minsize=\"2.047em\" maxsize=\"2.047em\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.05</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>1</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.95</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.05</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>0</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.95</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.05</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>1</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.95</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.967</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.278em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>226</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.033</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>rounded to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"326\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> decimal places.</p>\n</div></div>",
